charqui
=======

The state-to-state solver (src/position_*_step*.cpp, src/velocity_*_step*.cpp, src/brake.cpp,
the profile checks and the root finders) recreates the closed-form case analysis of

    Ruckig - Instantaneous Motion Generation for Robots and Machines
    Lars Berscheid and Torsten Kröger, https://github.com/pantor/ruckig
    Copyright (c) 2020 Lars Berscheid, MIT License

The intermediate-waypoint strategy (binary search over feasible pass-through
accelerations and velocities) follows

    Jonas C. Kiemel and Torsten Kröger, "Jerk-limited Traversal of One-dimensional Paths
    and its Application to Multi-dimensional Path Tracking", arXiv:2407.13423, 2024.

